From: Boot Time Experiment <boot-time@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] j7200: enable stabilized HyperFlash boot with load metrics

Port the TI 2023 DLL stabilization sequence while retaining the 2025 mux
framework. Keep R5 on the ROM-configured raw NOR path.
Retain the final bootloader metric and report NOR image-read durations.
Report FIFO/DLL/QRY stabilization duration separately in each probing stage;
briefly lift silent output only for completed duration measurements.

Support NOR SYSFW loading without SPI and reserve raw DTB/kernel slots.
Keep the SD root filesystem and existing boot-time instrumentation.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [fixed J7200 HyperFlash boot]

